=== H4 at n=7: does the score class determine H? (cut vs cycle) ===
  exact regular-circulant witnesses:
    jumps=(1, 2, 4): score=(3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3), H=189
    jumps=(1, 2, 3): score=(3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3), H=175
    jumps=(1, 3, 4): score=(3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3), H=133
  distinct H values inside the regular score class: [133, 175, 189]
  score multiset determines H?  False
  => same score/Hopfield ground layer, different cycle-space/H layer.
